#ASSERT `How much of an earlier payment counts against my redress payment question` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 30000 0 0 EQUALS JUST 30000
#ASSERT `How much of an earlier payment counts against my redress payment question` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 3000 2000 2000 EQUALS JUST 0

