#ASSERT `What counselling and psychological component will I get question` FALSE 3000 EQUALS `a counselling and psychological services payment of` 3000
#ASSERT `What counselling and psychological component will I get question` FALSE 5000 EQUALS `a counselling and psychological services payment of` 5000
#ASSERT `What counselling and psychological component will I get question` FALSE 7000 EQUALS `a counselling and psychological services payment of` 5000

