#ASSERT `Where does my offer of redress stand question` (`on` 15 3 2026) (`on` 14 9 2026) TRUE (`on` 15 9 2026) FALSE (`on` 1 1 2026) TRUE (`on` 20 9 2026) EQUALS `not taken to have declined: my review was not completed at the end of the acceptance period (s 45(3))`
#ASSERT `Where does my offer of redress stand question` (`on` 15 3 2026) (`on` 14 9 2026) FALSE (`on` 1 1 2026) TRUE (`on` 1 4 2026) FALSE (`on` 20 9 2026) EQUALS `declined: I declined in writing before the end of the acceptance period; I get no redress and release no one, and cannot apply again (s 45(1))`
#ASSERT `Where does my offer of redress stand question` (`on` 15 3 2026) (`on` 14 9 2026) TRUE (`on` 2 4 2026) TRUE (`on` 1 4 2026) FALSE (`on` 20 9 2026) EQUALS `declined: I declined in writing before the end of the acceptance period; I get no redress and release no one, and cannot apply again (s 45(1))`
#ASSERT `Where does my offer of redress stand question` (`on` 15 3 2026) (`on` 14 9 2026) TRUE (`on` 1 4 2026) TRUE (`on` 2 4 2026) FALSE (`on` 20 9 2026) EQUALS `accepted: I am entitled to redress, and the release from civil liability in s 43 has taken effect (ss 12(2)(e), 42, 43)`
#ASSERT `Where does my offer of redress stand question` (`on` 15 3 2026) (`on` 14 9 2026) FALSE (`on` 1 1 2026) FALSE (`on` 1 1 2026) FALSE (`on` 14 9 2026) EQUALS `open: I can still accept or decline until the end of the acceptance period (s 40)`
#ASSERT `Where does my offer of redress stand question` (`on` 15 3 2026) (`on` 14 9 2026) FALSE (`on` 1 1 2026) FALSE (`on` 1 1 2026) FALSE (`on` 15 9 2026) EQUALS `taken to have declined: I did not accept before the end of the acceptance period (s 45(2)); the Operator may still extend the period (s 40(4A)(b), (6))`

