#ASSERT `Does my prison sentence stop me getting redress question` 5 `a sexual offence, or an offence that includes the intention to commit one` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `not entitled: the sentence is for an offence listed in s 63(2)(a), unless the Operator determines under s 63(5) that I am not prevented`
#ASSERT `Does my prison sentence stop me getting redress question` 5 `unlawful killing, or an attempt or conspiracy to commit one` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `not prevented: a determination under s 63(5) that I am not prevented is in force`
