#ASSERT `Does my prison sentence stop me getting redress question` 6 `another offence` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `not prevented by s 63 on these facts: the Operator must consider whether I should undergo a special assessment process (s 63(2A))`
#ASSERT `Does my prison sentence stop me getting redress question` 8 `a State, Territory or foreign offence the Operator is satisfied is substantially similar to a terrorism offence` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `not entitled: the sentence is for an offence listed in s 63(2)(a), unless the Operator determines under s 63(5) that I am not prevented`

§ `Review`

-- s 73(2)(a), the regulative rule: notice 2 March 2026 is day 0, last day 30 March 2026 is day 28 (a period of 29 days
-- counting the notice day; the s 34(6) cases below use 29 March for the 28-day minimum).
#ASSERT `ends fulfilled` (EVALTRACE (`s 73(2)(a) -- I must apply for review within the review period` 28) 0 (LIST (EVENT `I, the survivor applying for redress` `apply for review of the Operator's determination` 28)))
#ASSERT (NOT (`ends fulfilled` (EVALTRACE (`s 73(2)(a) -- I must apply for review within the review period` 28) 0 (LIST (WAITUNTIL 29), (EVENT `I, the survivor applying for redress` `apply for review of the Operator's determination` 29)))))
-- expect: BREACH by me (no application for review within the review period)
#TRACE `s 73(2)(a) -- I must apply for review within the review period` 28 AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 29)
    PARTY `I, the survivor applying for redress` DOES `apply for review of the Operator's determination` AT 29

#ASSERT `Am I in time to apply for review question` TRUE (`on` 15 3 2026) (`on` 14 9 2026) (`on` 14 9 2026) EQUALS `in time (s 73(2)(a))`
#ASSERT `Am I in time to apply for review question` TRUE (`on` 15 3 2026) (`on` 14 9 2026) (`on` 15 9 2026) EQUALS `late: my application was approved, so the review period is my acceptance period; I can ask the Operator to extend the acceptance period, which extends the review period, while I have neither accepted nor declined (ss 34(4), (5), 40(2), (4A))`
#ASSERT `Am I in time to apply for review question` FALSE (`on` 2 3 2026) (`on` 30 3 2026) (`on` 30 3 2026) EQUALS `in time (s 73(2)(a))`
#ASSERT `Am I in time to apply for review question` FALSE (`on` 2 3 2026) (`on` 30 3 2026) (`on` 31 3 2026) EQUALS `late: my application was not approved; I can ask the Operator to extend the review period in exceptional circumstances, even after it has ended (s 34(7)-(10))`

-- s 34(6): notice 2 March 2026; 28 days starting on it end on 29 March; 6 months on 1 September.
#ASSERT `Is my review period as long as the Act requires question` (`on` 2 3 2026) (`on` 29 3 2026) EQUALS `it meets the Act: at least 28 days and not longer than 6 months, starting on the date of the notice (s 34(6))`
#ASSERT `Is my review period as long as the Act requires question` (`on` 2 3 2026) (`on` 28 3 2026) EQUALS `too short: it ends before the 28th day starting on the date of the notice (s 34(6)(b))`
#ASSERT `Is my review period as long as the Act requires question` (`on` 2 3 2026) (`on` 1 9 2026) EQUALS `it meets the Act: at least 28 days and not longer than 6 months, starting on the date of the notice (s 34(6))`
#ASSERT `Is my review period as long as the Act requires question` (`on` 2 3 2026) (`on` 2 9 2026) EQUALS `too long: it ends after the last day of 6 months starting on the date of the notice (s 34(6)(b))`

