#ASSERT `What happens to my offer after my review question` `the review affirmed the determination` TRUE TRUE FALSE (`on` 30 12 2026) EQUALS `the acceptance period is extended by an additional 2 months; its new last day is` (`on` 28 2 2027)
#ASSERT `What happens to my offer after my review question` `the review varied the determination` TRUE TRUE TRUE (`on` 14 9 2026) EQUALS `my review was taken to be withdrawn when I accepted or declined my offer (s 78(2))`
#ASSERT `What happens to my offer after my review question` `the review varied the determination` TRUE TRUE FALSE (`on` 14 9 2026) EQUALS `my offer is withdrawn and I get a new written offer (s 78(3))`
#ASSERT `What happens to my offer after my review question` `the review set the determination aside and substituted a new one` FALSE TRUE FALSE (`on` 14 9 2026) EQUALS `my offer is withdrawn, and I get no new offer because the determination no longer approves my application (s 78(3)(a))`
#ASSERT `What happens to my offer after my review question` `the review set the determination aside and substituted a new one` TRUE FALSE FALSE (`on` 1 1 2026) EQUALS `I get an offer of redress, as the determination now approves my application (ss 39, 76(3))`
#ASSERT `What happens to my offer after my review question` `the review affirmed the determination` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`on` 1 1 2026) EQUALS `the decision not to approve my application stands (s 75(2)(b)(i))`
#ASSERT `What happens to my offer after my review question` `the review varied the determination` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`on` 1 1 2026) EQUALS `the determination is changed, and still does not approve my application (s 76(3))`

